cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements, cite this repository."
title: "igpu-llm-bench: Vulkan vs ROCm decode throughput on an AMD Strix Point iGPU"
abstract: >-
  Archived and re-analysed decode-throughput measurements for a 35B
  mixture-of-experts model on a Radeon 890M integrated GPU. The headline is a
  2.32x raw Vulkan-over-ROCm gap at tg128, qualified to a defensible 1.4x-2.3x
  because the archived runs are not a controlled A/B. Includes a first-order
  memory roofline and a paired speculative-decoding comparison.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "igpu-llm-bench contributors"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: MIT
keywords:
